        "Lycosa provides a common operating surface for heterogeneous AI-capable devices. A user submits a task through Flutter; FastAPI authenticates the request, records its lifecycle and either dispatches to an eligible local Agent or invokes an explicitly selected external provider. Knowledge and workflow services share this control plane. The useful unit of coordination is a task or workflow step, not a shard of a jointly trained model. [L2, L4]",
